<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 200-3 V ENGLAND TEA 1ST DAY 1ST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 200-3 V ENGLAND TEA 1ST DAY 1ST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe were 200-3 in their first innings at tea on the first day of the first test against England on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 200-3 v England.</p>
</text>
